---
const steps = [
  { dir: 'right' as const, label: 'ClientHello', detail: 'versión · suites · SNI · key share' },
  { dir: 'left' as const, label: 'ServerHello + Certificate', detail: 'certificado X.509 firmado por CA · key share' },
  { dir: 'right' as const, label: 'Finished', detail: 'clave de sesión derivada (ECDHE)' },
];
---

<div class="space-y-4">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-center">
    <div class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-black/20 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-muted">
      cliente
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-black/20 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-muted">
      servidor
    </div>
  </div>

  <ol class="space-y-3">
    {
      steps.map((step, index) => (
        <li class="relative rounded-md border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.015] px-3 py-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span
              class:list={[
                'font-mono text-sm',
                step.dir === 'right' ? 'text-amber-200/90' : 'text-emerald-200/90',
              ]}
            >
              {step.dir === 'right' ? '──▶' : '◀──'}
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink/90">
              {index + 1}. {step.label}
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 pl-8 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-dim">{step.detail}</p>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>

  <div class="rounded-md border border-emerald-400/30 bg-emerald-400/5 px-3 py-2.5">
    <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-emerald-200/90">1 RTT · handshake completo (TLS 1.3)</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-dim">
      A partir de aquí, todo el HTTP viaja cifrado con AES simétrico. El certificado autentica al
      servidor; ECDHE aporta forward secrecy.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
